259
00:17:47,360 --> 00:17:49,480
Go, Master of Dragon Soldier!

260
00:17:50,040 --> 00:17:54,800
Attack Kizori Kalkos Giygas and wipe
out what's left of his life points!

261
00:17:55,160 --> 00:17:57,560
Your twisted game is done!

262
00:17:58,380 --> 00:18:01,340
End this duel with Saber Blast!

263
00:18:14,540 --> 00:18:15,480
That's it!

264
00:18:15,660 --> 00:18:16,760
The door's over!

265
00:18:29,580 --> 00:18:31,860
Such a valiant effort, Pharaoh.

266
00:18:32,300 --> 00:18:34,594
Unfortunately, your attack was in vain.

267
00:18:34,900 --> 00:18:36,080
Now watch this.

268
00:18:40,220 --> 00:18:42,580
What's going on? Beats me.

269
00:18:58,600 --> 00:19:01,860
You mind telling me why
we're floating in space?

270
00:19:02,320 --> 00:19:03,700
I don't know.

271
00:19:04,800 --> 00:19:05,897
It's Dots.

272
00:19:05,980 --> 00:19:08,040
I'd suggest you take us back.

273
00:19:08,260 --> 00:19:09,600
But we never left.

274
00:19:09,840 --> 00:19:14,457
What you're experiencing right now is
merely a vision generated by the Orycalcos.

275
00:19:14,540 --> 00:19:16,560
That's how the seal communicates.

276
00:19:16,800 --> 00:19:21,040
It shows us images of things as they
were, or as they might one day be.

277
00:19:21,680 --> 00:19:22,600
Just look.

278
00:19:22,820 --> 00:19:25,500
This is the darkness
that has always existed.

279
00:19:26,100 --> 00:19:28,537
What are you trying to
prove with all this?

280
00:19:28,620 --> 00:19:33,960
That human beings spend every second of
their lives surrounded by dark energy.

281
00:19:34,540 --> 00:19:37,440
It has contaminated our entire planet.

282
00:19:38,760 --> 00:19:43,540
And now, at the core of everyone's
heart, you'll find pure darkness.

283
00:19:44,060 --> 00:19:47,560
And when a human being crosses
paths with the Ori Kalkos,

284
00:19:47,780 --> 00:19:49,820
the evil inside is set free.

285
00:19:50,280 --> 00:19:51,840
It was on this very day,

286
00:19:52,080 --> 00:19:56,397
ten thousand years ago, that I came
into contact with this powerful force.

287
00:19:56,480 --> 00:19:58,500
And it opened my eyes.

288
00:19:58,820 --> 00:20:01,440
You mean it took over
your mind, don't you?

289
00:20:02,060 --> 00:20:05,354
I should have expected such
ignorance from you, Pharaoh.

290
00:20:05,800 --> 00:20:08,720
You choose to shut yourself
off from the truth.

291
00:20:09,580 --> 00:20:16,280
Just as my people did so long ago,
when I presided over paradise on earth.

292
00:20:23,480 --> 00:20:24,620
What's that?

293
00:20:25,240 --> 00:20:27,957
You're getting a glimpse
of the legendary city

294
00:20:28,040 --> 00:20:31,160
of Atlantis as it was
ten thousand years ago.

295
00:20:31,440 --> 00:20:33,460
when I ruled as king.

296
00:20:33,760 --> 00:20:34,740
You were king?

297
00:20:35,380 --> 00:20:38,840
Indeed I was, and I shall be once again.

298
00:20:39,160 --> 00:20:42,340
For when I defeat you,
paradise shall return!
